  "description": "Transaction decorator for Minded Framework. Provides automatic transaction management for commands and queries with support for nested transactions, configurable isolation levels, and automatic rollback on failure. Wraps operations in System.Transactions.TransactionScope with full async/await support. Includes comprehensive logging and configurable rollback strategies.",
